{"unit_id":"Bob-Bo1__dsh-stock-watch#card-zh","repo":"Bob-Bo1/dsh-stock-watch","commit":"8b74366224b59cc8eed547d431e4f1da2029bc74","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"stock-watch 是面向 DSH Web 的 A 股观察插件，在左侧边栏底部提供股票面板。它通过 Host 路由读取和保存本机持仓及自选数据，并从腾讯接口查询股票名称和行情。面板可添加、编辑、删除股票，展示持仓市值、成本、盈亏和自选行情。适合在 DSH 中查看个人 A 股组合；不需要 API Key，但需准备本机 holdings.json 并联网获取行情。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1267-1281","lib/index.js:228-313","lib/client.js:310-352"]}
{"unit_id":"Bob-Bo1__dsh-stock-watch#card-en","repo":"Bob-Bo1/dsh-stock-watch","commit":"8b74366224b59cc8eed547d431e4f1da2029bc74","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"stock-watch adds an A-share panel to the DSH Web sidebar. It reads local holdings and watchlists, fetches Tencent stock quotes, and shows portfolio P&L. Users can search, add, edit, and remove stocks. It needs a local holdings.json file and network access, but no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1267-1281","lib/index.js:228-313","lib/client.js:310-352"]}
